  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0-rc.1 — release candidate. The .pqfe container format (v2) is FROZEN for 1.x: every byte is pinned by cross-checked known-answer vectors and a written conformance spec, and any future change requires a 2.0 major. Publish-ready polish bundled in: PublicAPI analyzer + locked baseline (Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.PublicApiAnalyzers), package icon, Codecov coverage, IProgress<PqProgress> parity on the envelope-key bytes APIs, sync ReadOnlySpan<char> passphrase entry point, EnablePackageValidation against the 0.2.0 baseline.",
